      "created_at": "2020-09-22T22:40:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Oh boy, I sure am glad someone made a thread about this Letters Page episode so I can post the notes I've had saved all day! :V</p>\n<p>\"The Letters Page: Because we're consistent!\"</p>\n<p>Funnily enough, I just listened to the Dark Watch episode recently, so it was cool to get more Setback and Expatriette, as well as the question asked about that arc! :D</p>\n<p>Okay, we finally know Christopher's weakness: an anime about ringtones.</p>\n<p>The One Direction tangent was the funniest thing I have ever heard. XD \"Oh, those silly boys!\" I haven't laughed this hard in ages!</p>",
