    {
      "id": 264554,
      "name": "",
      "username": "LonelyMan",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:40:18.246Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Setback in the Coliseum? I want that story!  Obviously he doesn’t get a Title, but we don’t get <em>anything</em> as far as I can recollect.</p>\n<p>This is a way better look for Professor Pollution.  So yeah it’s actually a new character named Doctor Toxica, but that’s ridiculous, they were just making a new character to make a new character, it should be Prof Polly.  Indeed I’d probably rule that the Naturalist foe is a reboot version of the original Professor, and this time she’s black, because comics do that a lot.</p>\n<p>Setback was The Idealist before The Sentinels were a thing (and before Miranda existed).</p>\n<p>I would imagine that Black Fist, or Mister Fixer, or even Mantra probably has sufficiently short-range “blindsight” that he’s truly incapable of driving a car.  Not only can he not see the colored lights or read the stop signs, he probably can’t even sense two car lengths away.</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2025-12-02T15:51:06.888Z",
      "reply_count": 1,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 6,
      "readers_count": 5,
      "score": 6.2,
