      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Setback in the Coliseum? I want that story!  Obviously he doesn't get a Title, but we don't get *anything* as far as I can recollect.\n\nThis is a way better look for Professor Pollution.  So yeah it's actually a new character named Doctor Toxica, but that's ridiculous, they were just making a new character to make a new character, it should be Prof Polly.  Indeed I'd probably rule that the Naturalist foe is a reboot version of the original Professor, and this time she's black, because comics do that a lot.\n\nSetback was The Idealist before The Sentinels were a thing (and before Miranda existed).\n\nI would imagine that Black Fist, or Mister Fixer, or even Mantra probably has sufficiently short-range \"blindsight\" that he's truly incapable of driving a car.  Not only can he not see the colored lights or read the stop signs, he probably can't even sense two car lengths away.",
