      "raw": "[quote=\"LonelyMan, post:7, topic:20276\"]\nThis is a way better look for Professor Pollution. So yeah it’s actually a new character named Doctor Toxica, but that’s ridiculous, they were just making a new character to make a new character, it should be Prof Polly. Indeed I’d probably rule that the Naturalist foe is a reboot version of the original Professor, and this time she’s black, because comics do that a lot.\n[/quote]\n\nBut then how will they join forces in *Terror Forms*? ;)\n\nIn all seriousness, despite a vague surface-level connection of \"uses poison against society\", Professor Pollution and Dr. Toxica are actually exact opposites. Professor Pollution wants to eradicate all human life while causing an environmental apocalypse so that nature can begin to heal, and Dr. Toxica wants to upgrade humanity into a super-species and doesn't care what percentage of the population makes it through the transformation process.\n\n(Arguably *Necrosis* is extremely similar to Dr. Toxica, but he's got his own weird deal going on.)",
